        ['0.25 mol of solute is dissolved to make 100 cm³ of solution. What is its concentration?', ['0.025 mol/dm³', '0.0025 mol/dm³', '0.25 mol/dm³', '2.5 mol/dm³'], 'D', 'c = n ÷ V = 0.25 ÷ 0.1 dm³.', 3],
        ['The solubility of a salt is 30 g per 100 g of water. What mass of the salt dissolves in 250 g of water to form a saturated solution?', ['75 g', '12 g', '30 g', '280 g'], 'A', '30 × 250 ÷ 100.', 2],
