        ['The IUPAC name of HCOOH is', ['ethanoic acid', 'methanoic acid', 'methanol', 'formaldehyde'], 'B', 'One carbon.', 2],
        ['Methanol is dangerous to drink because it', ['is too sweet', 'is a solid', 'causes blindness and death', 'is very weak'], 'C', 'Toxic.', 1],
