        ['Adding common salt to precipitate soap is called ___.', ['salting out', 'salting-out'], '', 'Soap is less soluble in brine.', 3, 'fill'],
        ['The water-loving part of a soap molecule is described as ___.', ['hydrophilic'], '', 'The ionic head.', 3, 'fill'],
