        ['Iron is extracted from haematite in the', ['electrolysis of brine', 'Contact process', 'Haber process', 'blast furnace by reduction with carbon monoxide'], 'D', 'Fe₂O₃ + 3CO → 2Fe + 3CO₂.', 2],
        ['Limestone is added to the blast furnace to', ['remove silica impurities as slag', 'reduce the iron oxide', 'cool the furnace', 'add carbon'], 'A', 'CaO + SiO₂ → CaSiO₃.', 3],
